flowchart TB
    A[Monitored Signals] --> B{Threshold Breached?}

    A --> A1[Disputes]
    A --> A2[Escalations]
    A --> A3[Tool Failures]
    A --> A4[Policy Violations]
    A --> A5[Replay Coverage]
    A --> A6[Cost / Latency]

    B -- No --> C[Continue Normal Operation]
    B -- Yes --> D[Capability Owner Acts]

    D --> E{Response Mode}
    E --> F[Pause]
    E --> G[Degrade]
    E --> H[Defer]
    E --> I[Throttle]
    E --> J[Hard Stop]

    F --> K[Scoped Blast Radius]
    G --> K
    H --> K
    I --> K
    J --> K

    K --> L[Tenant / Region / Cohort / Tool Path]
    L --> M[Re-enable Criteria]
